## Data Source Disclaimer
The underlying problem statement text and institutional metrics are curated from the public, official Smart India Hackathon portal (sih.gov.in). This data is provided "as-is" for educational and structural convenience. This repository claims no official copyright or ownership over the primary source text provided by the Ministry of Education's Innovation Cell, AICTE, or participating ministries.

